    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Rod, Very Rare</em></p><p>This rod puts creatures into a suggestible, sleepwalking state. You can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDominateMo]{Dominate Monster} (save DC 17) from this rod, with the following modifications:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Duration.</strong> The spell’s duration is Concentration, up to 8 hours.</p></li><li><p><strong>Immunity.</strong> Creatures that don’t sleep, such as elves, or that have Immunity to the &amp;Reference[Exhaustion apply=false] condition automatically succeed on the save.</p></li><li><p><strong>Memory.</strong> An affected creature remembers nothing from the spell’s duration once the spell ends.</p></li></ul><p>Once the rod has been used to cast the spell in this way, it can’t be used to do so again until the next dawn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-NCRRNp9AX5eDKMwB\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Le sort lancé dure jusqu’à 8 heures (Concentration), mais l’effet <em>Dominated</em> du sort de dnd5e dure 1 heure : prolongez-le à la main. L’immunité des créatures qui ne dorment pas et la perte de mémoire sont à gérer vous-même.</p></section>",
